# Visualization improvements (2026-11-21): a section plane's report (area, mean, flow through it, mass flow), a displayer
# duplicated, saved views forgotten, a movie sweeping the plane through the cube.
budget p95 80 max 900
open $SB/ws/cube3d
click nav:results
wait 2
click res-tabs#1
wait-until text Boundary surfaces timeout 30
choose vz-add Section plane
wait 10
assert text On this plane
assert text area 1 m²
assert text flow through it along the normal
assert text kg/s
screenshot $OUT/1_report.png
click vz-dup#1
wait 10
assert text Section plane copy
choose vz-views Save this view
wait 3
choose vz-views Forget the saved views
wait 3
assert text Saved views forgotten
click vz-d#1
wait 3
choose vz-movie Movie: sweep the plane
wait-until text Recording timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 600
assert log log.vizmovie wrote visualization/movie_sweep_
screenshot $OUT/2_after.png
